	(text_box "3  12 V SOCKET (X2)\nFuse F1 5 A, 0.75 mm² wire. Centre stud = +, shell = -. Ring terminal on the stud (not a push-on spade) and a rubber boot over the back. Label it \"max 60 W\"." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 111.76 157.48 0) (size 40.64 38.1) (margins 1.5 1.5 1.5 1.5) (stroke (width 0.2) (type solid)) (fill (type color) (color 255 253 235 1)) (effects (font (size 1.75 1.75)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0391aa05-9261-5a90-acd3-d37a0b999bd2"))
	(text_box "4  USB SOCKET (X1)\nFuse F2 5 A, 0.5-0.75 mm² wire. One round socket with USB-C PD and USB-A QC3.0 (about 30 W + 18 W, typical figures). Its blue ring lights when it has power." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 154.94 157.48 0) (size 40.64 38.1) (margins 1.5 1.5 1.5 1.5) (stroke (width 0.2) (type solid)) (fill (type color) (color 255 253 235 1)) (effects (font (size 1.75 1.75)) (justify left top)) (uuid "61ca2908-4bd3-5ff3-9412-6cdfcd252ff3"))
	(text_box "5  WIRELESS CHARGER (U2)\nFuse F3 3 A. The wireless charging pad sits on the tray in front of the gear lever and unplugs at J2 (2-pin plug, about 3 A). Its Qi module must accept 12-14.6 V directly." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 198.12 157.48 0) (size 40.64 38.1) (margins 1.5 1.5 1.5 1.5) (stroke (width 0.2) (type solid)) (fill (type color) (color 255 253 235 1)) (effects (font (size 1.75 1.75)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e9aa9b07-246b-5760-9e2d-42b14322afec"))
	(text_box "6  RGB LIGHTS (the only switched circuit)\nFuse F4 2 A. The silver push button SW1 is the only control on the console: press it and the RGB lights come on. It switches the +12 V feed to the Bluetooth controller U1, so use a latching button rated 2 A DC or more. Colours and modes are set in the phone app.\nU1 drives three aluminium RGB LED heads through the 1-to-3 splitter J3 (4 wires each: V+ common anode, R, G, B). H1 and H2 shine into the side-glow fibres along the tops of the two side arms. Mount H3 properly or remove it.\nThe USB socket, the 12 V socket and the Qi pad do not go through the button: they are live whenever the car's outlet is live." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 241.3 157.48 0) (size 165.1 38.1) (margins 1.5 1.5 1.5 1.5) (stroke (width 0.2) (type solid)) (fill (type color) (color 255 253 235 1)) (effects (font (size 1.75 1.75)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f99ec104-53cc-5e84-b677-cde13f43ce27"))
	(text_box "" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 200.66 0) (size 110.49 82.55) (margins 1.5 1.5 1.5 1.5) (stroke (width 0.2) (type solid)) (fill (type color) (color 255 255 255 1)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "115db1c2-9768-5b63-b90d-76e03c2b71a3"))
